# Who is asked to look at what.
#
# A pull request touching a path below asks its owner for review
# automatically. It is not a wall — the review requirement on `main` asks for
# zero approvals today, so this is about the request reaching the right person
# rather than about blocking anybody.
#
# @orkcom-tech/devs is the team; naming the team rather than people means
# somebody joining or leaving is one membership change and not a file edit.

*                       @orkcom-tech/devs

# The parts where a mistake is expensive in a way review catches and tests do
# not: what the product promises, how it is released, and what runs somebody
# else's code.
/README.md              @orkcom-tech/devs
/CHANGELOG.md           @orkcom-tech/devs
/docs/                  @orkcom-tech/devs
/.github/workflows/     @orkcom-tech/devs
/deploy/                @orkcom-tech/devs
/internal/sandbox/      @orkcom-tech/devs
/internal/plugin/       @orkcom-tech/devs
/internal/gearnet/      @orkcom-tech/devs
